  "label": "VITA",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "comp-l6rrtves",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_2\" style=\"font-size:28px; line-height:1.3em;\"><span style=\"font-size:28px;\"><span style=\"font-family:din-next-w01-light,din-next-w02-light,din-next-w10-light,sans-serif;\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:0em;\">About</span></span></span></span></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "comp-l6rsjg8z",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"font-size:22px;\">I&lsquo;m trying to describe, with compassion and true to nature, the people close to me, the things that move me, what I see and can&rsquo;t explain, what I feel and don&rsquo;t understand. It&rsquo;s intuitive not intellectual work. There is poetry in everyday life that reveals itself when pictured. An inherent dignity in everything life touches. So I share my perspective, and what is shared with me. That is what I do.</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"font-size:22px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"font-size:22px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"font-size:22px;\">Ich versuche, mit Gef&uuml;hl und wesensgetreu, die Menschen zu beschreiben, die mir nahestehen. Die Dinge, die mich bewegen. Was ich sehe und nicht erkl&auml;ren kann. Was ich f&uuml;hle und nicht verstehe. Es ist intuitive, keine intellektuelle Arbeit. Im allt&auml;glichen Leben gibt es Poesie, die sich im Bilde offenbart. Alles, was das Leben ber&uuml;hrt, hat eine ureigene, ihm innewohnende W&uuml;rde. Ich teile was ich sehe und was mir zuteil wird. Das ist das Wesen meines Schaffens.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "comp-j7qcx5w3",
      "html": "<h2 class=\"font_2\" style=\"line-height:normal; font-size:28px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">Artist</span></h2>"
    },
    {
      "id": "comp-j7qcx5w1",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Born</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\">Stuttgart 09.12.1988</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span>​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Education</span>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\">2009-2012 FKS &ndash; Freie Kunstschule Stuttgart <a href=\"https://dictionary.cambridge.org/dictionary/english/taught\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">taught</a>&nbsp;by Andrej Dugin and Olga Dugina&nbsp;<br>\n2012-2018 Academy of arts D&uuml;sseldorf under Katharina Grosse and Siegfried Anzinger.</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span>​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Career</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\">2018-2021 painter and graphic artist in Stuttgart</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\">2021-2025 painter and graphic artist in Berlin</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\">since 2025 painter and graphic artist in Stuttgart</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span>​</span></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "comp-l5jlzh6x",
      "html": "<h2 class=\"font_0\" style=\"font-size:56px; line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:28px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">Scholarships</span></span></h2>"
    },
    {
      "id": "comp-l5jlumky",
      "html": "<h2 class=\"font_0\" style=\"font-size:28px; line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Pop Stipendum</span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">BV Pop, Stuttgart, 09.2022</span></span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Sommeratelier</span><br>\nKulturbahnhof Eller, D&uuml;sseldorf, 06.2018 &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br>\n&nbsp;</h2>"
    },
    {
      "id": "comp-j7qcxh50",
      "html": "<h2 class=\"font_2\" style=\"line-height:normal; font-size:28px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">Exhibitions</span></h2>"
    },
    {
      "id": "comp-j7qcxh51",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Three in a boat</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\">Galerie Crelle19, Berlin, 06.24</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\">with: Lea R&ouml;wer, Katharina Sucker</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span>​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Bl&uuml;ten tragen</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\">Praxisr&auml;ume Artimedes, Berlin, 10.08 - 29.02.2024</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\">with: Lea R&ouml;wer</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span>​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">Spielarten des Realismus</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">Galerie &quot;F&auml;hre&quot;, Bad Saulgau, 04.06. - 28.08.2022</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">with:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">Volker Blumkowski, Jiyun Cheon, Birgit Feil, Eckart Hahn u. Tibor Pogonyi</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span>​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">Es war ein Raum wie klares Wasser</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">Galerie ABTART</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">, Stuttgart, 01. - 07.2021</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">with:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">Jan Kromke u. Jan Peter Tripp&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span>​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">KEINFAMILIENHAUS</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">Citizen KANE Kollektiv, Stuttgart, 11.2020</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span>​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Menschen mit W&uuml;rde, aber auch m&uuml;de u.o. Nackt</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">Christuskirche Leverkusen, Leverkusen, 09.2020</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span>​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Lieber Daheim&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">Kultur Kiosk, Stuttgart, 08.2020</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span>​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Discoveries &ndash; Junge Positionen</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">Galerie Schwind, Frankfurt, 06.2020</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span>​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Dialog &ndash; Malerei</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">MediClin Staufenburg Klinik, Durbach, 10.2019</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">with: Katja Fezer-Eifert</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span>​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Tristes u.Banales in verschiedenen Stilen</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">Galerie Piwnica Papugi, Stuttgart, 02.2019</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span>​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">Die bisher gr&ouml;&szlig;te Ausstellung des Nicolas Sch&uuml;tzinger</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">Die Stille der Stadt mit Citizen KANE Kollektiv, Stuttgart, 01.2019</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span>​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Unbewusst &amp; ziemlich Spezifisch</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">Kunstverein Recklinghausen, Recklinghausen, 09.2018</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span>​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">Die Anmut des Allt&auml;glichen</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">Kulturbahnhof Eller, D&uuml;sseldorf, 09.2018</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span>​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Katja Fezer-Eifert u. Nicolas Sch&uuml;tzinger</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">Arbeitsgericht Stuttgart, Stuttgart, 04.2018</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">with: Katja Fezer-Eifert &nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span>​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Ausstellung der Merz-Schule</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">Galerie Stadtatelier Urban Hajek, Stuttgart, 01.2018</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">group exhibition with students of Merz-Schule</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span>​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Band Master Flash Ausstellung</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">Atomino Chemnitz, Chemnitz, 04.2014</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">group exhibition</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span>​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Werkschau #10</span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">Atelier Bunt Gestreift, Stuttgart, 04.2014</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">group exhibition</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span>​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Ausstellung der Merz-Schule</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">Galerie Stadtatelier Urban Hajek, Stuttgart, 02.2013</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.5em; font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\">group exhibition with students of Merz-Schule</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_